01:32.620 --> 01:35.400
Oh, Hyuga's coming up the field!

01:36.700 --> 01:39.140
A Tiger Header with perfect timing?!

01:39.700 --> 01:41.900
Folt reads the play and runs forward!

01:44.940 --> 01:45.820
What?!

01:47.780 --> 01:48.380
Go in!

01:49.400 --> 01:52.300
Goal! Goal!

01:52.860 --> 01:55.620
That's the end of the game!

01:55.620 --> 02:00.380
It has been a tough game for Japan, but they tied the game at the last minute!

02:00.380 --> 02:03.960
But it was our total defeat as a game.

02:03.960 --> 02:04.840
Tsubasa...

02:05.460 --> 02:13.940
It has become clear that we're still too weak to win the International Cup.

02:13.940 --> 02:18.420
We must keep aiming toward the top!

02:25.640 --> 02:30.740
<b>Restart Toward the World</b>

02:25.640 --> 02:30.740
<b>Restart Toward the World</b>

02:48.360 --> 02:51.580
Phew! Luckily, we got a draw in the end.

02:52.380 --> 02:57.660
I had some cold sweats, but I'm relieved they somehow got in a last-minute goal.

02:58.160 --> 03:00.920
All's well that ends well.

03:21.720 --> 03:23.980
Why are you all so gloomy?!

03:24.620 --> 03:28.800
We didn't lose. We tied with the Netherlands!

03:28.800 --> 03:29.460
That's true.

03:31.180 --> 03:36.420
We got a draw, but when it comes to soccer skills, we were completely beaten.

03:38.360 --> 03:40.100
Tsubasa's totally right.

03:42.060 --> 03:44.560
First, you all did well.

03:44.900 --> 03:48.460
You played well against the Netherlands.

03:48.460 --> 03:54.140
But each of you must think about how you played today and reflect on that.

03:55.200 --> 03:58.060
Yeah. We won't make it playing like that!

04:17.440 --> 04:19.700
I thought you were going to settle the scores today.

04:19.700 --> 04:21.000
Bring it on.

04:22.020 --> 04:27.520
The Dutch, having become unlucky, won't be participating in the International Cup,

04:27.520 --> 04:34.340
but the total soccer we witnessed make them one of the best teams in the world.

04:34.780 --> 04:39.820
You guys managed to get a draw against that Dutch team,

04:39.820 --> 04:44.340
but you all know deep inside your hearts how the game really went.

04:44.340 --> 04:50.620
After this game, you'll have to progress in order to challenge the rest of the world.

04:56.740 --> 04:59.560
We face a large barrier at the international level.

04:59.560 --> 05:01.660
This is something I saw clearly.

05:01.660 --> 05:07.660
Guys, we need to put in much more effort as we aim for the International Cup!

05:08.260 --> 05:09.540
He's right!

05:09.540 --> 05:13.300
I'll become a world-class striker!

05:13.300 --> 05:19.380
I'm going back to Germany and retrain in time for the International Cup.

05:20.020 --> 05:21.760
I'll do my best, too!

05:21.760 --> 05:22.180
Me, too! Me, too! Me, too!

05:22.180 --> 05:22.660
Me, too! Me, too! Me, too!

05:22.660 --> 05:24.000
Me, too! Me, too! Me, too!

05:22.950 --> 05:24.900
M-Me, too!

05:24.900 --> 05:28.980
Weren't you just saying a draw was a good result?

05:28.980 --> 05:34.640
I said that for moral support since everyone looked so down.

05:35.200 --> 05:37.200
Sure, if that's what you say.

05:37.200 --> 05:39.340
What?! Don't you believe me?

05:45.040 --> 05:47.140
Shingo, what will you do?

05:47.580 --> 05:51.380
I'm going back to Italy tomorrow and continuing my training.

05:51.380 --> 05:54.380
You're already going back to Italy?

05:54.380 --> 05:54.780
Yes.

05:55.240 --> 05:57.780
I'm still on their B Team, after all.

05:57.780 --> 06:01.200
I want to train really hard and get onto their first team!

06:01.200 --> 06:03.780
I also want to be in the International Cup.

06:03.780 --> 06:06.100
I see, Shingo. Go for it!

06:06.100 --> 06:07.140
Yes!

06:07.140 --> 06:08.480
All right!

06:08.480 --> 06:10.500
Let's meet again at the International Cup!

06:10.500 --> 06:11.700
Yeah!

06:18.540 --> 06:25.140
Coach Bernevelt, this game's proven to be a really good experience for the Japanese team.

06:25.580 --> 06:29.160
The Japanese players of this Golden Age... They're all great players.

06:29.160 --> 06:35.300
They never give up, and their determination shines in their eyes when it comes to soccer.

06:35.300 --> 06:36.460
Louvois,

06:37.040 --> 06:38.020
Katagiri.

06:38.480 --> 06:42.420
These youngsters will definitely become world-class players.

06:42.420 --> 06:44.440
Coach Bernevelt,

06:44.440 --> 06:46.340
thank you very much!

06:46.340 --> 06:49.240
Show me what you've got at the International Cup.

06:56.940 --> 06:58.660
Coach Louvois,

06:58.660 --> 06:59.820
thank you for everything.

07:00.660 --> 07:01.940
Katagiri-kun.

07:01.940 --> 07:03.480
We're only just starting.

07:03.480 --> 07:06.500
Our fight is only just beginning.

07:14.700 --> 07:16.540
Eh, Hawaii?

07:16.540 --> 07:17.900
Yeah.

07:17.900 --> 07:22.980
Professor Ariga, an expert in sports medicine, works at my university.

07:22.980 --> 07:25.680
I've heard his name.

07:25.680 --> 07:30.160
At the moment, I'm working as his research assistant.

07:30.160 --> 07:32.260
Really? That's awesome!

07:32.260 --> 07:37.200
We have a laboratory in Hawaii at our disposal.

07:37.200 --> 07:42.660
And he's offering to let you to come train there during your holiday, Tsubasa-kun.

07:42.660 --> 07:44.140
Can I really do that?

07:44.140 --> 07:44.900
Of course!

07:45.440 --> 07:49.340
The professor is a big soccer fan.

07:49.340 --> 07:53.940
So in exchange, he'd like to study you and find the secret of your talent.

07:53.940 --> 07:57.960
That's an offer I can't turn down.

07:57.960 --> 08:03.940
During the game against the Dutch, I felt that I've got to become a lot better!

08:04.660 --> 08:09.380
For this, I'd really like to get advice from a sports doctor.

08:09.380 --> 08:12.500
Professor Ariga will be really happy to hear that!

08:12.980 --> 08:15.520
Send him my thanks.

08:15.520 --> 08:16.780
All right. I will.

08:16.780 --> 08:17.640
See ya.

08:26.100 --> 08:27.340
A training session, huh?

08:27.340 --> 08:28.120
All right!

08:31.360 --> 08:35.440
I'm going to Italy tomorrow, so I'll leave this to you.

08:42.440 --> 08:43.580
Oh, Hyuga-kun?

08:44.060 --> 08:46.940
It's rare for you to come by the office.

08:46.940 --> 08:49.420
Matsumoto-san, I've got a request.

08:50.160 --> 08:51.160
And what would that be?

08:51.900 --> 08:54.180
I would like for you to go to Italy ahead of me.

08:54.980 --> 08:55.700
What?

08:56.140 --> 08:58.420
Give me two weeks.

08:59.240 --> 09:00.940
What's the matter?

09:00.940 --> 09:03.540
The Italian League is about to start.

09:03.540 --> 09:06.940
Against the Dutch, I understood...

09:06.940 --> 09:10.820
I won't accomplish anything in Europe unless I get better.

09:11.260 --> 09:14.340
You can do your training in Italy, can't you?

09:14.340 --> 09:16.260
Anyway, please.

09:17.680 --> 09:18.740
Hyuga-kun!

09:24.320 --> 09:28.280
Hawaii

09:33.980 --> 09:36.980
Tsubasa, get ready for the last dash!

09:36.980 --> 09:38.280
Yes!

09:39.500 --> 09:41.180
Ready... Go!

09:41.180 --> 09:42.070
Ready... Go!

09:43.600 --> 09:45.070
All right, go!

09:53.560 --> 09:55.590
Well done, Tsubasa-kun!

09:59.180 --> 09:59.900
Good!

10:01.140 --> 10:02.420
You must be thirsty, right?

10:03.180 --> 10:04.540
Oh, thank you!

10:04.540 --> 10:06.620
Professor, you must be tired, too.

10:08.460 --> 10:09.620
Here.

10:09.620 --> 10:11.080
Thank you.

10:11.080 --> 10:12.260
Where are the others?

10:16.300 --> 10:17.780
I can't do this anymore!

10:19.060 --> 10:20.820
Here, guys!

10:20.820 --> 10:22.860
Thank you! You're a lifesaver!

10:25.500 --> 10:29.960
I told you that it was impossible for you to follow him!

10:29.960 --> 10:33.360
As my research assistants, you guys need to shape up!

10:33.360 --> 10:33.940
Yes...

10:36.460 --> 10:38.580
Are you still continuing, Tsubasa?

10:38.580 --> 10:41.000
I'll go run a bit more.

10:42.400 --> 10:43.820
He's really a professional!

10:43.820 --> 10:44.980
What impressive stamina!

10:56.260 --> 10:57.300
Fight! Fight! Fight!

10:57.300 --> 10:58.220
Fight! Fight! Fight!

10:57.640 --> 11:00.980
Kira Soccer Club

10:58.220 --> 10:59.240
Fight! Fight! Fight!

10:59.240 --> 11:00.140
Fight! Fight! Fight!

11:00.140 --> 11:01.160
Fight! Fight! Fight!

11:01.160 --> 11:02.040
Fight! Fight! Fight!

11:02.040 --> 11:02.980
Fight! Fight! Fight!

11:02.980 --> 11:04.180
Fight! Fight! Fight!

11:02.980 --> 11:05.080
It's too soon to be tired!

11:04.180 --> 11:05.180
Fight! Fight! Fight!

11:05.080 --> 11:06.620
And raise your voices!

11:05.180 --> 11:06.160
Fight! Fight! Fight!

11:06.160 --> 11:07.040
Fight! Fight! Fight!

11:07.040 --> 11:08.220
Fight! Fight! Fight!

11:08.220 --> 11:08.960
Fight! Fight! Fight!

11:08.960 --> 11:09.940
Fight! Fight! Fight!

11:09.940 --> 11:10.820
Fight! Fight! Fight!

11:10.820 --> 11:11.920
Fight! Fight! Fight!

11:11.540 --> 11:13.900
It's been a while, Coach Kira.

11:11.920 --> 11:12.900
Fight! Fight! Fight!

11:12.900 --> 11:13.860
Fight! Fight! Fight!

11:13.860 --> 11:14.920
Fight! Fight!

11:14.920 --> 11:15.880
Fight! Fight!

11:15.480 --> 11:17.860
You guys came all the way here?

11:17.860 --> 11:18.440
Yes!

11:27.240 --> 11:28.540
You guys, drink.

11:30.360 --> 11:31.700
Thank you very much.

11:35.700 --> 11:42.980
I had chances to shoot against the Dutch, but their speedy defense blocked me.

11:42.980 --> 11:45.240
I couldn't even score a goal.

11:45.920 --> 11:47.040
Coach Kira.

11:47.040 --> 11:51.040
Train me to be a world-class striker!

11:52.180 --> 11:56.420
Kojiro, in your eyes, you're still fighting that Dutch game.

11:57.080 --> 12:02.180
That'll keep you from playing long, professional soccer seasons.

12:02.900 --> 12:07.060
You must never keep a game in your heart for long.

12:07.960 --> 12:12.420
You need to empty the doubts hidden in it, Kojiro.

12:12.420 --> 12:13.980
Empty?

12:20.520 --> 12:22.600
Oh, here it is!

12:30.680 --> 12:31.740
Kojiro.

12:32.740 --> 12:36.060
Empty your heart by continuously hitting this ball.

12:36.060 --> 12:40.920
If you can transfer your power into this ball,

12:40.920 --> 12:42.580
you'll forget your doubts.

12:42.580 --> 12:43.680
Yes, sir!

12:54.740 --> 12:55.880
Emptiness...

12:55.880 --> 12:58.080
A heart without any doubts, huh?

13:06.260 --> 13:07.380
All right.

13:08.240 --> 13:10.280
I'll isolate myself on that mountain!

13:10.280 --> 13:11.460
Hyuga-san!

13:11.460 --> 13:16.520
I'll cleanse my heart of the doubts Coach Kira was talking about.

13:16.520 --> 13:17.900
Captain!

13:21.480 --> 13:22.420
Last dash!

13:22.420 --> 13:23.030
Hurry!

13:24.160 --> 13:25.540
All right, now for the last!

13:25.540 --> 13:26.680
Yes!

13:32.440 --> 13:34.060
How are you? Want some rest?

13:34.740 --> 13:36.420
No. Please let us continue.

13:38.580 --> 13:41.080
This time, run in zig-zags.

13:41.080 --> 13:41.660
Yes!

13:41.660 --> 13:42.900
Tsubasa.

13:42.900 --> 13:47.780
In order to for you to become a world-class top player, there is one thing you're lacking:

13:49.140 --> 13:50.540
muscles!

13:50.980 --> 13:54.680
In order to keep up in European soccer, which is very physical,

13:54.680 --> 13:58.540
you need a whole lot of muscles.

13:58.540 --> 13:59.080
Yes!

13:59.080 --> 14:01.800
Good, let's do movements to the sides next.

14:01.800 --> 14:02.720
To the right!

14:03.720 --> 14:04.660
The left!

14:05.110 --> 14:05.740
One more time!

14:05.740 --> 14:06.580
Left! Right! Left!

14:06.580 --> 14:07.200
Left! Right! Left!

14:07.200 --> 14:08.160
Left! Right! Left!

14:09.940 --> 14:11.840
A whole lot of muscles, huh?

14:14.420 --> 14:18.820
When we're together like this, it reminds me of the days at Nankatsu.

14:18.820 --> 14:19.620
You're right.

14:19.620 --> 14:23.500
But Tsubasa-kun has become a professional player now.

14:23.500 --> 14:24.620
Yes.

14:25.220 --> 14:30.660
I can't really play soccer, but I'd like to become Tsubasa-kun's trainer in the future.

14:30.660 --> 14:35.180
I think I've come to understand a bit of the secret to his talent during this training camp.

14:35.180 --> 14:36.660
Eh?

14:36.660 --> 14:40.700
Depending on if you're right- or left-footed, one of the legs is stronger.

14:40.700 --> 14:44.240
For example, when you practice balancing on a ball,

14:44.240 --> 14:48.520
you can keep the balance on one leg, but not the other.

14:48.520 --> 14:53.620
But Tsubasa-kun's muscle mass is as strong for both legs.

14:54.100 --> 14:57.700
That's why he can keep his balance on both sides.

14:58.260 --> 15:02.140
Tsubasa-kun has always thought carefully about how he trained.

15:02.140 --> 15:07.980
And he's taking the opportunity at this camp to strengthen his muscles even more?

15:08.500 --> 15:13.820
Tsubasa-kun has always said he wanted to become a strong player.

15:15.700 --> 15:19.460
I see! Tsubasa-kun wants to become a "fanta-gladiator"!

15:19.460 --> 15:21.740
Eh, a what?!

15:21.740 --> 15:28.180
He wants to be both a <i>fantasista</i> and a gladiator on the field.

15:28.180 --> 15:33.900
Tsubasa-kun wants to combine those two aspects and become a "fanta-gladiator"!

15:39.660 --> 15:43.340
Germany - Hamburg

15:52.940 --> 15:54.380
Schneider!

15:55.120 --> 15:57.420
I saw the game against the Netherlands.

15:57.860 --> 16:01.620
Japan did well against the Dutch team.

16:01.620 --> 16:04.500
Did you come here only to tell me that?

16:05.280 --> 16:07.660
I've come here today to recruit you.

16:07.660 --> 16:10.040
Wakabayashi, come to Rotburg.

16:10.040 --> 16:12.060
We're making an official offer.

16:12.060 --> 16:15.020
I'm not leaving Grünwald.

16:16.260 --> 16:20.260
You went to Rotburg because that was your natural path.

16:21.060 --> 16:26.300
I understand that you want to make your dad's team stronger.

16:26.300 --> 16:28.340
But I'm different.

16:28.340 --> 16:32.180
I'm in debt to this team who took me, who came from an undeveloped soccer nation,

16:32.180 --> 16:35.100
and turned me into the player I am.

16:35.100 --> 16:37.340
I can't leave them just like that.

16:38.660 --> 16:40.500
A debt towards your team, huh?

16:40.500 --> 16:45.660
You won't be able to progress if you constantly think like that.

16:46.740 --> 16:52.940
Rotburg is gathering star players from several national teams.

16:52.940 --> 16:57.780
Without a doubt, we'll be at the top of the German League next season!

16:57.780 --> 17:01.700
And the only keeper that I have enough faith in to be on this star team

17:02.220 --> 17:05.260
is you, Wakabayashi.

17:05.700 --> 17:10.340
Come with me and create the best team in Europe, no — the best in the world!

17:10.340 --> 17:14.820
Schneider, what you just told me makes me more certain of my decision.

17:15.820 --> 17:19.860
I will stop all shots this upcoming season!

17:20.700 --> 17:24.080
Even your Fire Shot!

17:24.720 --> 17:26.100
Is that your answer?

17:26.100 --> 17:27.080
Yeah.

17:28.760 --> 17:31.140
You're still the stubborn one.

17:36.360 --> 17:40.180
You'll remain an opponent for me to beat, after all.

17:45.660 --> 17:48.240
The stronger my opponent, the better.

17:48.240 --> 17:50.800
I'll be champion of the German League this season,

17:50.800 --> 17:55.080
in order to attain the level needed for the International Cup.

17:55.080 --> 17:57.260
Just like Tsubasa and Hyuga!

18:12.550 --> 18:13.960
Damn it!

18:37.660 --> 18:40.500
By shooting the ball at its center,

18:40.500 --> 18:42.260
I increase the power of the shot.

18:42.700 --> 18:44.200
Emptiness.

18:44.200 --> 18:45.700
I've got to obtain emptiness!

18:54.660 --> 18:55.540
Kojiro.

18:55.540 --> 18:58.700
Empty your heart by continuously hitting this ball.

19:00.700 --> 19:05.060
If you can transfer your power into this ball,

19:05.060 --> 19:06.640
you'll forget your doubts.

19:27.300 --> 19:29.740
I see. You're going back?

19:29.740 --> 19:33.140
Yes. Thank you for everything!

19:33.140 --> 19:34.460
Drink some.

19:34.460 --> 19:35.140
Okay.

19:40.100 --> 19:44.180
Kojiro, I told you about offensive soccer.

19:46.020 --> 19:50.200
The stronger your opponent is, the more power you need to face them.

19:50.200 --> 19:52.020
That's what soccer's about.

19:52.020 --> 19:53.900
Never forget to attack!

19:53.900 --> 19:54.880
I won't!

20:03.380 --> 20:06.240
Hyuga-san's gone back to Italy.

20:06.240 --> 20:07.060
Yes.

20:07.820 --> 20:11.920
Show those Italians the level of Japanese soccer.

20:11.920 --> 20:15.440
To us, you'll remain Captain for eternity!

20:19.100 --> 20:20.820
Last dash!

20:21.480 --> 20:22.620
All right, let's stop there.

20:24.050 --> 20:24.780
Yes!

20:31.140 --> 20:36.500
I've got the impression that Tsubasa-kun's training made him even bigger.

20:36.500 --> 20:37.300
It has.

20:37.740 --> 20:43.060
He's completed a new armor in order to fight the top European teams.

20:43.060 --> 20:44.540
I'm done.

20:44.540 --> 20:48.540
All right, Tsubasa. We're finished with the program now. Well done!

20:48.540 --> 20:52.840
Professor Ariga, I'm truly thankful for what you've done.

20:53.480 --> 20:55.700
Thanks to you, I got some intensive training.

20:55.700 --> 21:00.180
Nah. I got some good data, so I'm the one who's thankful.

21:00.180 --> 21:02.260
I'm expecting a lot from you in Europe.

21:03.000 --> 21:03.780
Yes!

21:15.780 --> 21:17.800
The Spanish League is up next, eh?

21:17.800 --> 21:18.700
Yeah.

21:18.700 --> 21:21.660
With the body I've built up here,

21:21.660 --> 21:25.740
